s":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1788570509261138566,"creation_channel":"mcp","deps":[{"link_uuid":"8d46067e-b12e-4cb2-bd13-4a8be426a72f","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"dd8b-d69a-57af-4f12"},{"link_uuid":"8e7b7ddb-adb1-46e6-9acf-5c7831ccd2d3","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"7232-87d8-7f73-4410"},{"link_uuid":"e190da5e-d1da-4dab-a919-df57460e4833","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"59a7-cb88-f2f9-4148"},{"link_uuid":"63a77ca5-b2a1-4c06-b8f8-dd37e5ad214c","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"e114-ce10-0c57-49d4"}],"description":"## Context / Problem\nThe two nginx files contain repeated or historical comments identified by the audit and revalidated on current `origin/main`. Shortening them must preserve security-sensitive proxy rationale.\n\n## Approach\nEdit only standalone comments and blank lines in the declared files. Preserve nginx directives byte-for-byte and retain the minimum current rationale needed by operators.\n\n## Scope\n- `infra/nginx/mcp-upstream.conf` — Preserve the committed safe seed, generated live include, host-nginx glob consumer, and default upstream.\n- `infra/nginx/rebar.conf.template` — Preserve TLS/HSTS, switchable MCP upstream, literal forwarded scheme, op-cert guard, SSE buffering/timeouts, RFC 9728 metadata, and Gerrit proxy behavior. Preserve explicitly: `/mcp` and `/mcp/` both map to app `/mcp` to avoid Starlette's absolute 307 and bearer downgrade; `proxy_redirect default` precedes explicit upgrade rules because any explicit rule disables the implicit default; Gerrit uses pathless `proxy_pass` with no rewrite so encoded `%2F` survives. All explanatory comments in the file are in scope.\n\nConsumers are nginx, the upstream materializer, MCP/Gerrit clients, operators, and security review.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] DD `preserve-nginx-data` exits 0.\n- [ ] Every Scope constraint and named consumer has a leaf-linked TSV row with full before/final block citations.\n- [ ] Every Scope/consumer row records `semantic-preservation=PASS`.\n- [ ] Every required TSV row has a non-empty `reviewer_session`.\n- [ ] Every `reviewer_session` identifies a reviewer who did not author the remediation.\n- [ ] Every edited comment block has one TSV row satisfying `before_words > after_words`.\n- [ ] Every edited-block row records `bloat-removal=PASS`.\n- [ ] DD `nginx-consumer-contracts` exits 0.\n- [ ] DD `diff-integrity` exits 0.\n- [ ] DD `repository-gates` exits 0.\n\n## Verification\nRun the recorded comment-only guard, focused MCP/op-cert infrastructure tests, path-scoped diff check, and worktree-venv lint.","env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","file_impact":[{"path":"infra/nginx/mcp-upstream.conf","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"infra/nginx/rebar.conf.template","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","managed_refs":[["parent","49ac-d7e5-f383-4d7f"],["relates_to","59a7-cb88-f2f9-4148"],["relates_to","e114-ce10-0c57-49d4"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":"49ac-d7e5-f383-4d7f","parent_status_uuid":"12e60a8b-a354-4bbf-920f-ce0602d735d6","plan_review_phase":"execution","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":3,"repos":["rebar"],"reverts":[],"status":"in_progress","tags":["comments","documentation","maintainability","grouped-remediation"],"ticket_id":"36f4-ae53-2199-42c1","ticket_type":"task","title":"Condense comments in infra/nginx","verify_commands":[{"command":"rtk git diff --exit-code --ignore-matching-lines='^([[:space:]]*#[^!].*|[[:space:]]*#[[:space:]]*|[[:space:]]*;.*|[[:space:]]*<!--.*|[[:space:]]*.*-->|[[:space:]]*)$' HEAD^ HEAD -- infra/nginx/mcp-upstream.conf infra/nginx/rebar.conf.template","dd_id":"preserve-nginx-data","dd_text":"Prove the leaf commit changes only standalone comments or blank lines."},{"command":"rtk env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" pytest -q tests/unit/test_mcp_on_box_infra.py tests/unit/test_opcert_deploy_infra.py","dd_id":"nginx-consumer-contracts","dd_text":"Exercise MCP proxy/auth and op-cert guard infrastructure contracts."},{"command":"rtk git diff --check HEAD^ HEAD -- infra/nginx/mcp-upstream.conf infra/nginx/rebar.conf.template","dd_id":"diff-integrity","dd_text":"Reject whitespace errors in declared paths."},{"command":"rtk env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" make lint","dd_id":"repository-gates","dd_text":"Run repository lint and policy gates."}]},"source_event_uuids":["29b81516-0e49-4667-b6c6-c96659e7945d","7e0f3a26-c964-47fe-9af3-4494eceefe6c","2c5d4373-5388-4d7d-9efc-8e554517cbcc","7a380acf-853b-48d1-a5a3-d8af0c60d987","15f88be7-fe2b-49f5-a97f-f92ead76f642","459256f3-85db-4e09-aa71-db61d7c28e2f","929e99d8-40ac-466a-aec6-6e39ca7c928d","84ef63f6-8ace-41a6-ae4e-49b6af155441","14e2616f-7867-4c98-86b9-2e921a044712","e190da5e-d1da-4dab-a919-df57460e4833","12e60a8b-a354-4bbf-920f-ce0602d735d6","4d646c09-192e-46ea-a0a7-744044578961","c6d79cb4-78e7-4ded-8a88-93694dc3cefa","a4a2fcb5-57cf-45ea-a6aa-1287d0761dfc","63a77ca5-b2a1-4c06-b8f8-dd37e5ad214c"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1788731841876974951,"uuid":"1ec66d7a-40db-460b-8ad3-9f7e29c714e1"}